`,e.jsxs(t.li,{children:[e.jsx(t.strong,{children:"Loss and pre-clip gradient norm together."})," In the loss, find the first change of slope or variance, or an outlier, and do not assign a learning stage from the shape alone. Ask whether the norm left its band before, at or after the loss event. At the same steps, check the precision events (finite-value checks, skipped steps and loss-scale changes) and the clip coefficient."]}),`
`,e.jsxs(t.li,{children:[e.jsx(t.strong,{children:"Checkpoints."})," Compare the last known-good checkpoint with the first affected state: model, optimizer, schedule, loss-scaler state and data cursor."]}),`
